# libLLVM for wasm (build/llvm-wasm/): the source tarball, host tblgen and the
# cross build tree live under WORK/CACHE outside the repo; only the packaged
# result lands in out/, and it is committed deliberately (~140 MB) so a clone can
# link the compiler without rebuilding LLVM. `npm run build:llvm-wasm` (Linux or
# WSL) regenerates it.
# build/llvm-wasm/out/

# Python bytecode from patches/apply-patches.py
__pycache__/
*.pyc

# Outputs of verify/run-probe.sh (regenerated on every verify)
build/llvm-wasm/verify/*.o
build/llvm-wasm/verify/*.wasm

# The language package's payload (packages/crystal-wasm/build-assets.sh): about 22 MB
# gzipped — the compiler (12 MB of it), the linker (8 MB), the standard library
# (1.3 MB) and the sysroot archives. Too large to commit; regenerate with
# `npm run demo:assets` (Linux or WSL). The receipts that pin its bytes are
# committed, and `npm pack` refuses to publish without matching assets.
packages/crystal-wasm/assets/crystal/
